    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jeremy Murphy & Associates are delighted to bring to the market this spacious 3-Bedroom Detached home. This owner-occupied home has an off-street parking with a lovely spacious rear south-facing garden.\r\n\r\nThis property is in turn-key condition and has had recent upgrades bringing it to a high standard. Situated in a desirable location, this home offers easy access to local amenities, schools, and public transport links. Whether you are commuting to work or exploring the vibrant city of Cork, you will find everything you need within a short distance.The property also benefits from existing plumbing for a potential second bathroom downstairs, offering excellent scope for further enhancement and added convenience.\r\n\r\nViewing is Highly Advised to Fully Appreciate!\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of Hallway, Living Room and Kitchen/ Dining Room. Upstairs there are Three Bedrooms and a Family Bathroom.\r\n\r\nFRONT OF PROPERTY\r\nTo the front of the property there is off street parking along with access to the rear from both sides of the property.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY 4.09m x 1.78m\r\nThe entrance hallway comprises of timber laminate flooring, one centre light, one radiator, and one window overlooking the front of the property.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM 4.60m x 3.18m\r\nThis bright and spacious living room has timber laminate flooring, one centre light, one radiator and two windows overlooking the front of the property. The living room also has a fireplace with a stunning surround.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING 5.07m x 3.20m\r\nThis bright and spacious area features tiled flooring, recessed spotlighting, two central ceiling lights, a radiator, and a window overlooking the rear garden, allowing for plenty of natural light. It is fitted with a range of cream wall and base units complemented by contrasting worktops and tiled splash backs.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is well equipped with a stainless-steel sink and drainer, plumbing for a washing machine, an integrated oven, four-ring hob with extractor hood overhead, an integrated dishwasher, and space for a freestanding fridge/freezer. An island with a timber-effect worktop and breakfast bar provides additional preparation space and comfortably accommodates bar stools, creating the perfect spot for casual dining or socialising. A single door and a set of double patio doors provide direct access to the south-facing rear garden, creating an ideal flow between the indoor and outdoor living spaces. The adjoining dining area comfortably accommodates a table with seating for four to six people.\r\n\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING 2.94m x 1.80m\r\nThere is space for storage located under the stairs. The stairs and landing are fully carpeted. Via the landing there is one centre light, one window overlooking the side and access to the hot-press.\r\n\r\nMASTER BEDROOM 3.17m x 3.19m\r\nThis double bedroom features carpet fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and two windows overlooking the front of the property. There are also integrated slide robes.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 3.93m x 2.54m\r\nThis double bedroom features solid timber flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3 2.69m x 2.69m\r\nThis double bedroom features solid timber flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM 1.96m x 1.81m\r\nThree-piece bathroom suite incorporating a bath with an electric shower attachment, wash hand basin and wc. There is tiled flooring, one window with frosted glass paneling overlooking the front of the property along with one centre light and one radiator.\r\n\r\nREAR OF PROPERTY\r\nThe generous south-facing rear garden is a wonderful outdoor space, with convenient access from both sides of the property as well as direct access from the kitchen/dining area. Offering plenty of space for outdoor furniture, children's play, or gardening, this beautifully positioned garden is perfect for relaxing and entertaining family and friends, making it an ideal setting to enjoy throughout the summer months."
      },
